  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "3D動畫實作與歷史建物永續I",
    "sub_ename": "IMPLEMENTATION OF 3D VIRTUAL REALITY AND THE SUSTAINABILITY OF HISTORICAL BUILDINGS (I)",
    "describe_ch": "虛擬實境共分成三大類，分別是影像式虛擬實境、幾何式虛擬實境與混合式虛擬實境，而不論是哪種類型，3D模型的建立都是最基礎的過程。本課程將透過對知名或歷史建物的3D描繪，去學習繪製的技術及瞭解建物落成的歷史，並在繪製完畢後，透過渲染後的3D模型與模擬造景，去反思歷史建物永續、共融和再生的可能。最終透過成果虛擬實境化的方式，讓各種想法的發揮可以透過沉浸式的平台，做更深度的共享與交流。",
    "describe_eh": "There are three main types of virtual reality (VR) simulations: image-based, geometry-based, and mixed reality. No matter what kind of VR, the most basic process is to build 3D models. This course will lead students to build famous or historic buildings’ model. Students will learn the basic knowledge of modeling techniques, and realize the history of these buildings. Afterwards, this course will also combine 3D rendering with environmental simulation, which can make students reflect the possibility of historic buildings sustainability, inclusion and renewal. Through VR simulations, students can use their imagination in the immersive platform to communicate with each other more deeply.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學習3D繪製及渲染技能，培養實做與將想法具現化的能力。",
      "describe_en": "Learn modeling and rendering techniques. Cultivate students' practice ability and idea realization."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "理解歷史建物背景與設計成因，並深入探索老建物永續、共融和再生的可能。",
      "describe_en": "Realize the history and design of these buildings. \r\nGain a deeper understanding of these historic buildings’ sustainability, inclusion and renewal.\r\n"
    }
  ],
